'''Cuckoo Crew 12''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was added in [[Version 3.7 Update|Version 3.7]] and could be unlocked through a [[Serial Codes|Serial Code]] in the Korean Version.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 182
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Cuckoo Crew 12
|name2 = Cuckoo Crew 12+1
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Cuckoo Crew 12+1''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
While the Cuckoo Crew may be successful on YouTube, their success does not carry over to the battlefield. Area attacks and decent range only really help Cats with the stats to actually use them.

