==Trivia==
*Cuckoo Crew 12 is based off of [https://www.youtube.com/user/realcuckoocrew Cuckoo Crew], a famous Korean YouTube troupe. Their Evolved Form adds their dog [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IxP1T4H_ctw Tofu].
*Cuckoo Crew 12+1 is one of the only cats to contain a canine: others being [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Wolf]] and [[Anubis the Protector (Uber Rare Cat)|Anubis the Protector]].

